(Sending a Message) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. User writes a message in the React Native composer.) Tj
T*
(2. Frontend creates a clientMessageId.) Tj
T*
(3. UI adds an optimistic pending message.) Tj
T*
(4. Frontend sends REST request to backend.) Tj
T*
(5. Backend validates auth, payload, conversation membership, and business rules.) Tj
T*
(6. Backend stores the message in MySQL.) Tj
T*
(7. Backend creates receipt rows for conversation members.) Tj
T*
(8. Backend updates conversation last_message_id.) Tj
T*
(9. Backend invalidates affected Redis caches.) Tj
T*
(10. Backend emits Socket.io events.) Tj
T*
(11. Frontend replaces optimistic message with persisted message.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Reading a Conversation) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. Chat screen requests recent messages.) Tj
T*
(2. Backend checks recent message cache when eligible.) Tj
T*
(3. Backend loads messages from MySQL if cache misses.) Tj
T*
(4. Backend batch-loads receipts and attachments to avoid N+1 queries.) Tj
T*
(5. Backend returns cursor-based page.) Tj
T*
(6. Frontend marks conversation delivered/read when appropriate.) Tj
T*
(7. Backend updates read state only if there is an actual state change.) Tj
T*
() Tj
